Input: {"question": "What sport is Michael Myers associated with?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 0, "end": 89, "text": "including the AFC Championship game versus the Pittsburgh Steelers where he made tackles."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 90, "end": 196, "text": "He made 50 tackles, while helping the Broncos finish with a 13-3 record which clinched the AFC West title."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 197, "end": 291, "text": "Myers started all 16 games for the Broncos and had a career high 57 combined tackles (37, 20)."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 292, "end": 346, "text": "He had 2 sacks, 2 passes defensed and forced a fumble."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 347, "end": 414, "text": "On April 19, he signed as a free agent with the Cincinnati Bengals."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d00", "start": 415, "end": 555, "text": "After being waived on August 31, he was re-signed in the second week and finished with 34 tackles, one sack, 2 passes defensed and his first"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "start": 0, "end": 1, "text": "."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "start": 2, "end": 34, "text": "^ `` Michael Myers sues NFL '' ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "start": 35, "end": 55, "text": "February 28 , 2012 ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "start": 56, "end": 86, "text": "Retrieved February 19 , 2023 ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "start": 87, "end": 377, "text": "External links [ edit ] Former Browns brighten Broncos '