8-d3a1cb313e5c:d04", "start": 415, "end": 507, "text": "Meanwhile, Ryan Nichols is hunting Michael down after seeing him attack and kidnap his wife."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d04", "start": 508, "end": 578, "text": "In the end, Michael frames Ryan for the murders and buries Lisa alive."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d04", "start": 579, "end": 634, "text": "Hutchinson explains that \"Nightdance\" was an attempt to"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d05", "start": 0, "end": 134, "text": ", the text makes clear he neither knows nor cares who the former sheriff is , despite having killed his daughter all those years ago ."}, "D6S2": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d05", "start": 135, "end": 152, "text": "Boom , Headshot !"}, "D6S3": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d05", "start": 153, "end": 286, "text": ": Karen shoots at his right cheek , leaving a bloody wound , which is enough to stun him and allow Laurie to attack him from behind ."}, "D6S4": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d05", "start": 287, "end": 521, "text": "Came Back Strong : When battling the angry mob in Halloween Kills , he at first has trouble landing hits against multiple opponents , only managing to slice one attacker 's arm before a combination of bullets and melee weapons put him"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d06", "start": 0, "end": 149, "text": ", Keri was unconvinced that her brother was dead , and proceeded to steal what she thought was his body and drive off with it in the coroner 's van ."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d06", "start": 150, "end": 344, "text": "As the confused paramedic regained consciousness in the back of the van , Keri deliberately crashed the vehicle , sending them both crashing down a hill and trapping the man underneath the van ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d06", "start": 345, "end": 531, "text": "She prepared to finish Michael Myers off once and for all , and after pausing momentarily when the masked man showed a glimpse of humanity , mercilessly chopped his head off with an ax ."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "American football", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "NFL", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01:c1"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "basketball", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d02:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01:c0", "entity": "Michael Myers", "scope": "sport", "claim": "Michael Myers is associated with American football.", "answer": "American football", "quote": "^ `` Michael Myers sues NFL '' . February 28 , 2012 . Retrieved February 19 , 2023 . External links [ edit ] Former Browns brighten Broncos ' landscape v t e Dallas Cowboys 1998 NFL draft selections Greg Ellis Flozell Adams Michael Myers Darren Hambrick Oliver Ross Izell Reese Tarik Smith Antonio Fleming Rod Monroe Retrieved from `` https : //en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php ? title=Michael_Myers_ ( American_football ) & oldid=1272014186 `` Categories : 1976 births Living people Players of American football from Vicksburg , Mississippi American football defensive ends American football defensive tackles Hinds Eagles football players Alabama Crimson", "original_document_number": 2}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0408-d3a1cb313e5c:d01:c1", "entity": "Michael Myers", "scope": "league", "claim": "Michael Myers is associated with the NFL.", "answer": "NFL", "quote": "^ `` Michael Myers sues NFL '' . February 28 , 2012 . Retrieved February 19 , 2023 . External links [ edit ] Former Browns brighten Broncos ' landscape v t e Dallas Cowboys 1998 NFL dra